  ],
  "$recording": "Cases marked AUTHORED are written from the integration guide; the rest were recorded from a live deployment on 2026-09-11. Only the recorded ones are evidence about the gateway.",
  "$version_note": "Bumped to 2 on 2026-09-11 when the corpus was re-recorded from a live deployment (AXO-47). Bodies were replaced and chat_completion_timings.json was removed, which broke a consumer referencing it by name. Anything vendoring these files should compare this number against its own copy: a bump means bodies moved."
}
